      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRASS IS GREENER (6) box seated before sticking on well to finish 2 lengths away in third (26.18) at Warrnambool in a Maiden over 450m. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Racing well and deserves a win. PAW IROHA (3) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Geelong behind Frida Science (23.17) in a Rank Limit - Maiden. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Expected to feature again. ASTON TAURUS (4) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Maigret (22.67) in a Maiden. Has the pace to be prominent. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Must be included in calculations. RECANTED (2) placed last time and cannot be ignored.",
